<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
  <Document>
    <name>Barrie to Burlington + GTA: thrift and music shopping</name>
    <description>Researched 2026-11-05. 85 thrift stores plus 3 optional commercial music shops. Donation-only sites excluded. Blue: Goodwill; red: Salvation Army; orange: Talize; purple: Value Village; green: Mission Thrift; yellow: independent charity; pink: optional music. Barrie Salvation Army relocation has conflicting dates: call first. Retail listing verification is not a phone/live inventory check.</description>
